This project patches LiteLLM (https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm), which is
licensed under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 Berri AI.

gateway/patched/apply_patches.py contains short excerpts of LiteLLM source
code, used as anchors to locate and change that code at image build time.
The patched image is built from the upstream image named in
gateway/patched/Dockerfile.
